[00:12.57]1. If we have listened to Christ, will we show it?
[00:25.15]His teaching shines as it shows us the way.
[00:31.15]It makes us happy to hear and to know it,
[00:37.15]But we’ll be blessed if we know and obey.
[00:41.15](Chorus)
[00:45.15]Listen, obey, and be blessed
[00:47.66]When you hear God’s will expressed.
[00:56.06]If you’d be happy and enter his rest,
[01:04.46]Listen, obey, and be blessed.
[01:15.28]2. Our way of life, like a house, gives protection
[01:26.11]When it is built on the rock, not on sand.
[01:32.25]If we apply Jesus’ loving direction,
[01:38.49]We’ll build a life which on bedrock will stand.
[01:43.72](Chorus)
[01:48.96]Listen, obey, and be blessed
[01:54.19]When you hear God’s will expressed.
[01:59.42]If you’d be happy and enter his rest,
[02:05.06]Listen, obey, and be blessed.
[02:33.68]3. Just as a tree rooted deep by the waters
[03:02.30]Gives of its fruit when each season arrives,
[03:08.66]If we obey as God’s own sons and daughters,
[03:15.06]We’ll all be blessed and enjoy endless lives.
[03:20.12](Chorus)
[03:25.18]Listen, obey, and be blessed
[03:30.23]When you hear God’s will expressed.
[03:35.29]If you’d be happy and enter his rest,
[03:53.66]Listen, obey, and be blessed.